This file marks an UNTOUCHED Claritty seed template.

While it exists, the identity gate (scripts/check-not-template.mjs) is inactive,
so the bare seed's own tests/CI stay green.

👉 DELETE THIS FILE the moment you start building your app.

Deleting it turns on the identity gate, which then refuses to let the build be
"done" until your app has its own visual identity (palette, landing page, logo,
name) and the seed's example code is gone.

See IDENTITY.md for the full KEEP-vs-REPLACE manifest and the redesign checklist.
